Comment: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:40.41,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:02.53,0:00:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:04.01,0:00:05.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:06.05,0:00:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ohh... goodness gracious.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:09.33,0:00:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those darn seraphim\Ntrashed this place!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.15,0:00:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd think they'd show some\Nrespect for the lab they were born in.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to give them\Na stern talking to.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.88,0:00:19.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.28,0:00:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.57,0:00:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An explosion?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras! What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras! Do you copy?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.79,0:00:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in, Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.81,0:00:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.25,0:00:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.39,0:02:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Building C.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Camsnail 12.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.23,0:02:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scan the area for signs of life.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your mission is\Nto locate Pythagoras.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.02,0:02:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was there an accident?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, let him be safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.97,0:02:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.66,0:02:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something there!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.51,0:02:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shadow!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.83,0:02:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They destroyed\Nthe Camps now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This stupid ear thing's broken.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go talk\Nto Helmet Guy for a minute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.15,0:03:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.22,0:03:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.99,0:03:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jeez, can we catch\Na break for once?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know\Nwhere to start.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is enormous!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.56,0:03:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe how long it takes\Nus to play hide and seek in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.52,0:03:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.91,0:03:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.62,0:03:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.75,0:03:22.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that face?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.86,0:03:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! What?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So shiny!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.80,0:03:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diamonds?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what you're\Nfocused on?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.64,0:03:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.70,0:03:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least say They're so pretty!\NOr something normal!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.69,0:03:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, let her have this.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.40,0:03:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does it matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're leaving the island\Nanyway, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't let 'em go to waste!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is not the issue here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.49,0:03:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith her priorities!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to debug her!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.44,0:03:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heavy.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.62,0:03:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should head\Nback now.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be\Nlooking for Stella!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.11,0:04:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll set it down for now,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you'd better lead us\Nthrough here on our way back!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You behave while\Nmommy's gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, those\Nare man-made diamonds.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.06,0:04:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're for industrial use.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.72,0:04:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.72,0:04:22.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you make diamonds?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is paradise!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.96,0:04:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with your eyes?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.56,0:04:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The future is full of dreams!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.11,0:04:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These people are maniacs!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stella, please,\Ncome out already!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.03,0:04:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wish our tour was under\Nless stressful circumstances.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atlas? Quick question.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.81,0:04:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci really smashed up your face,\Nbut now it looks great!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.93,0:04:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it work like a mask?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the future, you can make\Nyour body how you want!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Replacing some parts is easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.58,0:04:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.51,0:04:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A creature?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.78,0:04:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or Vegapunk, perhaps?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.35,0:05:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.27,0:05:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.85,0:05:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what we\Ncall an organoid.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.75,0:05:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an artificial organ!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.96,0:05:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This technology is vital\Nto the future of medicine!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.11,0:05:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can make organs\Nall on your own?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.67,0:05:16.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How wonderful.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.18,0:05:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will certainly save lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what a relief, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought it was\Nsomething else.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.38,0:05:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.46,0:05:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dismembered piece of Vegapunk\Nput on gruesome display.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would you\Neven think that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Helmet Guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is completely absurd.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison! This is Shaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.69,0:05:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please respond!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.82,0:05:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've lost contact\Nwith the other Satellites.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.96,0:05:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, your thing break, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.61,0:05:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was talkin' to everybody fine a second\Nago, but then it got all messed up.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I'm not gettin'\Nanything at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.09,0:05:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, uh... I didn't break it,\Nhonestly, I swear!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.94,0:05:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not what I...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.07,0:05:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.90,0:05:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stayed here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.39,0:05:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On my head!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.85,0:06:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.81,0:06:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The video feeds\Nare shutting off,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.25,0:06:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One after another,\Nafter another.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.55,0:06:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.51,0:06:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.49,0:06:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone is\Ninterfering with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.73,0:06:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have an intruder.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.20,0:06:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.85,0:06:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe you and I\Nget to go on a voyage together!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.06,0:06:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were at Big Mom's\Nparty, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.91,0:06:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please tell me I'm a good boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get serious\Nand look for Stella.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.96,0:06:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silly puppy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.99,0:06:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't search every\Nnook and cranny.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lab is entirely too big.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This'll take all day.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.23,0:06:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're on a weapons development floor,\Nso don't set off any shock waves.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.67,0:07:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.09,0:07:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.74,0:07:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.19,0:07:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh. Keep those eyes open, York!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.16,0:07:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.76,0:07:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.69,0:07:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where could he have\Nwandered off to?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why did he have\Nto disappear now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.57,0:07:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Government will\Nbe after us any second!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's use this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! I got a wife and kids!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chill, it's a Bubble Gun.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's a Bubble Gun?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sounds cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.09,0:07:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait till you see it pop off!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its attack\Ncan deflect anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said attack, but it\Nsounds more like a shield.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd understand if\Nyou saw it in action.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.45,0:07:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you like\Na demonstration?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.51,0:07:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, for real?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.73,0:07:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's made by Vegapunk,\NI bet it's super sweet.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me what\Nthis baby can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.43,0:07:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really\Ninto this, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.44,0:08:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.23,0:08:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.70,0:08:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.84,0:08:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see something?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have eyes on Stella?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's smoke.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something blew up.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.67,0:08:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole bridge is out!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.29,0:08:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it the baddies?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This just keeps getting worse!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's someone on the floor!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.81,0:08:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stay with me, buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.76,0:08:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.73,0:08:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gah! He's been decapitated!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.17,0:08:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His whole head musta\Nbeen blown clean off!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this must have been\Nthe explosion that we heard earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.70,0:08:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras? Wiggle your fingers\Nif you can hear me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.59,0:08:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.94,0:08:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.94,0:09:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I come in peace!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yellow, everybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, is that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.98,0:09:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're a football!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.07,0:09:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It couldn't have been\Nan accident, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.93,0:09:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause you look like you've\Nbeen stripped for parts!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's very confusing!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is to say,\NI saw the culprit,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but, well, I-it was, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.13,0:09:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.\NJust spit it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe I made\Na design error.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.52,0:09:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I promised myself I'd\Nwork on my confidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.48,0:09:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.06,0:09:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.71,0:09:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's York?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.00,0:09:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.25,0:09:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought Edison\Ntold you to stay put!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be\Nwaiting for us outside, goofy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you're...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.10,0:09:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.94,0:09:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.82,0:09:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, York!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.63,0:09:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.55,0:09:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.42,0:10:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found a little cutie over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.23,0:10:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Love-Love...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Love-Love...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.09,0:10:21.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.25,0:10:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why? We gave you a new command!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.81,0:10:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Try again!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.09,0:10:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's getting closer!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.23,0:10:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you\Nlistening to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.53,0:11:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.65,0:11:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need help!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.06,0:11:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.91,0:11:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't those guys supposed\Nto be on our side?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.53,0:11:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seraphim!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.81,0:11:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Hawk.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.04,0:11:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Bear.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.84,0:11:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bear!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.59,0:11:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Abort all assault operations!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.04,0:11:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who gave you\Nthe command to attack?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that really all it\Ntakes to stop them?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.73,0:11:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't know why, but they\Nwere coming after CP0.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.24,0:11:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't wanna let them\Ndie handcuffed like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It woulda left a bad\Ntaste in my mouth.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.73,0:12:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not listening to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.09,0:12:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.67,0:12:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.95,0:12:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I regret everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She hears us,\Nbut she doesn't obey!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hover! Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.71,0:12:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn on your Dom Shoes!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.57,0:12:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.00,0:12:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.28,0:12:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.77,0:12:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No I don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.43,0:12:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Catch me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.06,0:12:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.59,0:12:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this heaven?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.50,0:12:59.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me home, sweet angels.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.26,0:13:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.67,0:13:01.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Communications are\Nout all over the lab!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.26,0:13:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.68,0:13:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.55,0:13:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was really hopin'\Nthat would work!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it cool to fight back?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause if so, I'mma\Ngive her a wallop!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.61,0:13:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.83,0:13:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to stay away,\Nfor your own good!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.89,0:13:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She'll kill you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's our masterpiece.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.60,0:13:32.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strongest\Nform of humanity!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.21,0:13:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.42,0:13:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was too close!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.26,0:13:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.69,0:13:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is something\Nterribly wrong here.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.62,0:14:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.35,0:14:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That includes us\Nit would seem.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.21,0:14:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would tear those\Nthings apart if I could.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's no use.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you have to do\Nis uncuff us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.61,0:15:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And let us do\Nwhat we do best.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're disgusted.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.00,0:15:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's say we do uncuff you guys,\Nand you help us win this fight...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.72,0:15:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe you're just gonna\Nlet us cuff you again when it's over?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.84,0:15:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no reason\Nto lie to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.45,0:15:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our only objective now is\Ngetting out of this alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.91,0:15:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us help, and we'll let you cuff\Nus again when we're through.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.15,0:15:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take the cuffs off, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.29,0:15:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.92,0:15:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was clearly\Njust bullshit, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.19,0:15:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.15,0:15:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the bald guy's move!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.66,0:16:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He has the power\Nof the Dice-Dice Fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.63,0:16:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need food.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two months.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.17,0:16:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two months without\Na proper meal.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.70,0:16:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.43,0:16:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to die in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.58,0:16:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two months ago...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We completed\Nour investigation here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We left the island like normal,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.31,0:16:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we were attacked by\Nthe Sea Beast Weapons.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we headed\Nback to the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol sent backup\Nwhen we didn't return,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.36,0:17:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but as you can see, they got\Nstuffed in this room, same as us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.34,0:17:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This whole time we all assumed\Nyou were the mastermind.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was completely\Nblind to the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Egghead is my lab.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I allowed this to happen\Nunder my own roof.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a fool I was.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.19,0:17:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I see the signs?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It should have\Nbeen impossible.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.19,0:17:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the Government to find\Nout about my research.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.91,0:17:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naval Branch G9!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All ships have been deployed!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.41,0:17:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Counting all sizes,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The total number of vessels\Ncurrently en route to Egghead...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now exceeds 100!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.76,0:17:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.30,0:18:07.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cp zero.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.17,0:20:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.34,0:20:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.82,0:20:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.10,0:22:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ursus...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.93,0:22:44.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shock.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.79,0:25:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:16.03,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx130\fscy130\1c&HE6E6E6&\blur0.75\fad(729,0)\bord2.7\pos(960,790)\1a&HFF&\t(529,729,\1a&H00&)}LABOPHASE DEATH GAME
