Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.21,0:10:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seraphim. Stay right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite\Nmy authority level,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the seraphim won't\Nrespond to my commands.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.40,0:14:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which leaves only one\Npossible explanation.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.19,0:14:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're receiving orders...\Nfrom another Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.20,0:14:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all beginning\Nto make sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.14,0:14:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our comms failed us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.72,0:14:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we were caged by\Nour own security system.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was all by design.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a traitor\Nin our midst,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.60,0:14:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they want every\None of us dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.98,0:14:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright. Hey,\NStraw Hat, Roronoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.66,0:14:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you say\Nthe four of us call a truce
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.66,0:14:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and try to work together?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.84,0:14:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll establish\Na temporary alliance.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.13,0:18:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro. Do you recognize\Nthat devil fruit power?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.53,0:18:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back when we fought\NBaroque Works.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a full-body blade power.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did\Nyou do with Lucci?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dropped him over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.71,0:19:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.19,0:19:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There, see? We told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.59,0:19:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't protect us and win\Nagainst those things!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to let us help\Nyou before it's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.14,0:19:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your mission?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.47,0:20:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The elimination\Nof Doctor Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.69,0:20:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All seven of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.71,0:20:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.69,0:20:07.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you say\Nthat to his face?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.68,0:20:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm.\NAnd what about Stussy,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who betrayed you to help us?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you'll\Nlet her off easily.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.59,0:20:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. She'll get\Nwhat's coming to her.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.25,0:20:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just digging our graves deeper\Nand deeper, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.82,0:20:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.35,0:20:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was\NNami's scream.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There must be more\Nseraphim here.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.36,0:21:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably all four\Nof 'em. No one is safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.69,0:21:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's seven Vegapunks\Nwe gotta look out for.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.12,0:21:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, uh... how many more?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.04,0:21:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That power.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmet Guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need the keys.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.44,0:21:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.09,0:21:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Very well.\NI trust your judgment.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.05,0:22:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Promise me that you\Nwill protect Stella at any cost.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.47,0:22:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No prob! You got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.73,0:22:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! We're gonna\Nstop all four seraphim.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.86,0:22:13.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gonna be a jerk\Nwhen we're done?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.62,0:22:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna try\Nto hurt my friends
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.09,0:22:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just 'cause you can't\Nbeat me, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.45,0:22:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think provoking\Nhim like that's gonna work?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.82,0:22:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care about them!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.67,0:22:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters\Nto me right now is killing you.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.64,0:22:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.09,0:22:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, no, I won't\Nkill your friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.11,0:22:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not until after I've buried\Nyou once and for all!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.78,0:22:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. It did work!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.09,0:22:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.09,0:22:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!\NWe've got an emergency here!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.87,0:23:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fourth Gear!\NBounce Man!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.60,0:23:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Time to finish this!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.31,0:23:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.94,0:23:28.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.03,0:23:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you\Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Purgatory... Oni Giri!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.86,0:23:39.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tempest Kick! White Thunder!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.84,0:23:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.86,0:23:57.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Six King...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.11,0:24:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kong...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.36,0:24:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(696.5,1053)}{\fad(150,150)}– ...Gun!\N– ...Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.07,0:24:38.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,On an island\Nsomewhere in the New World...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.77,0:24:46.31,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...a familiar\Nscene plays out in a bar.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.53,0:24:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on,\Ndon't be so stingy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.87,0:24:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not kiddin'\Naround here, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.61,0:24:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, I wanna go.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why won't you\Ntake me with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.83,0:24:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me on your ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.41,0:24:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.97,0:25:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we have a strict "no\Nhotheaded brats" rule.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.81,0:25:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's just policy.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better stop while\Nyou're ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.73,0:25:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep this up and our captains
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are going to get\Ntheir feelings hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.81,0:25:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.75,0:25:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shanks is the only\None I wanna sail with!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.47,0:25:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been getting\Nstronger, by the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.37,0:25:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be your best\Ncrew member in no time!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.78,0:25:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta take me, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.34,0:25:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something already!\NYou're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.87,0:25:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All this yelling just\Nproves me right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.85,0:25:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh,\Ncome on! This sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.31,0:25:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry\Nto interrupt you, Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.11,0:25:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we got hit!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.49,0:25:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bastard wants\Nanother fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.42,0:25:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bunch of the younger\Nguys are angry
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.71,0:25:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they got blindsided like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.03,0:25:48.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now they're\Nlooking for blood!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.02,0:25:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.50,0:25:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking this might\Nturn into a big battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.35,0:25:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.29,0:26:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if\Ntheir timing's good or bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.81,0:26:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were just about to sail\Nour way outta here.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.94,0:26:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems I got carried away\Nand chatted for too long.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.73,0:26:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's not every day
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.81,0:26:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you get to see an old friend\Nyou thought was dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.75,0:26:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What choice did I have?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.61,0:26:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our enemy does have\Nquite the temper.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.86,0:26:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's rich,\Ncomin' from you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.75,0:26:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who'd you think pissed\Nhim off in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.44,0:26:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.89,0:26:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I like to hear!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.75,0:26:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.23,0:26:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're going to war?\NOh, wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.51,0:26:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let Elbaph\Nbecome a battlefield.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.72,0:26:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! What a man!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.42,0:26:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our duty is to keep\Nthis island safe from harm.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.73,0:26:53.15,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a proud\Ncountry of warriors: Elbaph.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.07,0:27:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll help\Nus protect the place,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.19,0:27:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,right, Dorry, Brogy?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.23,0:27:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be\Nmy pleasure, brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.24,0:27:12.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks\Nlike you're fired up!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.91,0:27:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, before we get into this,\Ngo ask him a question.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.81,0:27:25.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain\NKid, you mean? What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.78,0:27:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is about\Nto be a turning point for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.55,0:27:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ask if he\Nreally wants to fight me.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.52,0:27:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because there is another way.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.32,0:27:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he leaves\Nhis Road Poneglyphs behind,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.53,0:27:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let him go.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.82,0:27:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.49,0:28:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\frx0\fry0}Looks like those\Nships lined up on the shore
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.65,0:28:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\frx0\fry0}are our enemies,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.70,0:28:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,along with these\Njackasses shooting at us.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.49,0:28:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why, you ask?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.08,0:28:09.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because they're all\Nfrom pirate crews
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.96,0:28:13.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that serve under the wing\Nof Red-Haired Shanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.82,0:28:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Each one of them is\Nknown and feared.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.88,0:28:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad you could make it, Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.86,0:28:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're so happy to see\Nyour handsome face again!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.30,0:28:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Beckman, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.94,0:28:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey,\Ndon't get too close to the boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.03,0:28:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us pay you a tribute\Nwhile you're here!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.30,0:28:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, thanks, but we don't\Nwork like that, old pal!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.39,0:28:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Last time, we never\Ngot our shot at Shanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.11,0:28:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His crew sent us packing before\Nwe even caught a glimpse of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.68,0:28:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, after teaching\Nus a lesson, that is.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.80,0:29:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't need\Nto remind you, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.40,0:29:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But taking\Nyour arm was just a warning.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.97,0:29:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, they'll\Nbe coming for your life.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.54,0:29:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll try, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.64,0:29:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this time,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.69,0:29:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're going to be the ones\Nleaving empty-handed!
